dd5e93f9d356653e679e424f6990d02.webm?t=1772611175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525510/extras/edd5e93f9d356653e679e424f6990d02.mp4?t=1772611175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has lost the war. The wastelands are now crawling with rogue AI and scavenging war machines. You and your mercenary crew fight to survive, taking on contracts from the last remaining cities built high above the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525510/extras/bf7bdf520f98fd8eddf6b0bcd5e335ad.avif?t=1772611175\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525510/extras/2b7b78a6372e1a7d7607e1185719f337.poster.avif?t=1772611175\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525510/extras/2b7b78a6372e1a7d7607e1185719f337.webm?t=1772611175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525510/extras/2b7b78a6372e1a7d7607e1185719f337.mp4?t=1772611175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly across a massive open world filled with settlements, machine lairs, quests, and unexpected events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on contracts, recruit new pilots, and shape your crew\u2019s legend one battle at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525510/extras/06cb09ac358021249ee0a1d6c3349804.avif?t=1772611175\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p